WEBVTT

00:00:07.390 --> 00:00:07.790
Oh, my.

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:30.240
It's me.

00:02:04.790 --> 00:02:06.250
You can't get caught that easily.

00:02:09.940 --> 00:02:10.660
Good! Boss!

00:02:15.850 --> 00:02:16.130
OI!

00:02:16.410 --> 00:02:16.570
Let's do it!

00:02:21.660 --> 00:02:22.200
Thank you for your viewing.

00:02:26.520 --> 00:02:26.900
Thank you for watching.

00:02:27.060 --> 00:02:28.020
Thank you for watching.

00:02:28.980 --> 00:02:29.420
Watch me!

00:02:30.190 --> 00:02:32.210
No matter how many times I'm caught, I'll get out of here.

00:02:32.350 --> 00:02:38.660
The punk was arrested again.

00:02:38.980 --> 00:02:41.180
You're a man, aren't you?

00:02:41.240 --> 00:02:43.150
Oh, lunch! Lunch!

00:02:44.120 --> 00:02:46.560
It's Sunday, but where are you going so early in the morning?

00:02:47.690 --> 00:02:51.320
I'm going to the Marine Park with my friend.

00:02:51.880 --> 00:02:53.560
Mr. Midori is with you, too.

00:02:53.560 --> 00:02:54.020
I see.

00:02:54.320 --> 00:02:55.070
I'm going.

00:02:55.410 --> 00:02:56.340
Take care.

00:02:56.680 --> 00:02:59.810
Marine Park

00:03:00.000 --> 00:03:00.320
Bye

00:03:27.510 --> 00:03:29.290
I want to ride it one more time!

00:03:37.960 --> 00:03:50.220
Thank you.

00:03:50.710 --> 00:03:55.660
I'll be right back.

00:03:55.900 --> 00:03:56.300
What?

00:04:31.660 --> 00:04:38.470
Teacher, what is that big robot?

00:04:39.270 --> 00:04:41.630
It's called Jumbo, teacher.

00:04:42.790 --> 00:04:44.660
I've been friends with Jumbo for a long time.

00:04:45.460 --> 00:04:46.020
Oh.

00:04:47.100 --> 00:04:52.570
About 20 years ago, when the number of robots began to increase explosively,

00:04:53.640 --> 00:04:56.080
the first white wave was opened here.

00:04:56.160 --> 00:04:58.020
To tell you about the arrival of the robot era.

00:05:04.950 --> 00:05:06.470
Jumbo was created as a symbol of the Wanderer's World.

00:05:07.990 --> 00:05:09.230
The world's largest robot.

00:05:10.970 --> 00:05:11.790
You're so big and kind.

00:05:13.120 --> 00:05:14.260
It was a popular item among children.

00:05:20.120 --> 00:05:20.640
Sensei, right?

00:05:21.530 --> 00:05:22.070
At the opening ceremony,

00:05:23.120 --> 00:05:24.980
I was chosen to play the role of handing out bouquets to Jumbo.

00:05:26.100 --> 00:05:26.520
Really?

00:05:27.030 --> 00:05:27.350
Amazing!

00:05:27.900 --> 00:05:28.880
Thank you for watching!

00:05:42.180 --> 00:05:54.900
That's a big robot, we're waiting for you to wait for you.

00:06:00.480 --> 00:06:00.860
Niji

00:06:40.560 --> 00:06:44.150
Even after that party, Jumbo was left here as a souvenir.

00:06:46.490 --> 00:06:49.360
We were close by.

00:06:50.330 --> 00:06:52.640
Jumbo and I were always friends.

00:06:53.320 --> 00:06:59.100
When it was hard...

00:07:00.250 --> 00:07:06.600
When I was sad, Jumbo didn't say anything, but he always comforted me.

00:07:17.860 --> 00:07:21.400
Everyone was obsessed with the new robot and forgot about Jumbo.

00:07:22.760 --> 00:07:25.700
Jumbo was completely rusty without being cared for.

00:07:31.050 --> 00:07:34.000
But I'm going to be your friend forever.

00:07:38.270 --> 00:07:41.240
Jumbo? Oh, that Jumbo.

00:07:41.420 --> 00:07:43.620
But do you know him?

00:07:44.240 --> 00:07:48.280
Of course. He was very popular while I was a robot.

00:07:48.480 --> 00:07:52.330
But when I finished my job, I was all alone.

00:07:52.890 --> 00:07:54.890
I feel sorry for him.

00:07:56.060 --> 00:07:59.300
Excuse me, is Jumbo alone?

00:08:00.000 --> 00:08:00.340
It's not a bird's nest!

00:08:01.850 --> 00:08:02.010
Huh?

00:08:30.000 --> 00:08:33.720
Welcome to the Kruisel prison in this southern village.

00:08:33.720 --> 00:08:36.610
I'm Tawashi, and this is Skunk.

00:08:36.990 --> 00:08:39.190
Sir, this is the master of the abduction.

00:08:39.990 --> 00:08:42.510
Please take good care of him.

00:08:42.730 --> 00:08:44.520
Don't worry.

00:08:45.450 --> 00:08:47.630
No matter what kind of criminal you are,

00:08:47.790 --> 00:08:49.680
you can't escape from here.

00:08:52.540 --> 00:08:54.360
That's...

00:09:02.040 --> 00:09:04.560
I'll get out of here as soon as possible.

00:09:05.200 --> 00:09:14.610
It seems that Tsukanku is a man who does not choose a way to escape.

00:09:15.170 --> 00:09:18.690
Please leave the security of this prison for a while.

00:09:18.910 --> 00:09:20.710
The police are worried.

00:09:21.770 --> 00:09:25.520
This Kuroizel prison is a small island, and it is strictly guarded.

00:09:25.940 --> 00:09:27.800
There is no gap for one cat to enter.

00:09:27.800 --> 00:09:28.780
There is no gap.

00:09:30.000 --> 00:09:31.690
But chief, is it possible to use a robot?

00:09:33.410 --> 00:09:40.320
For that reason, we are running a Guardian Pulse that confuses the AI of robots all over the island.

00:09:40.960 --> 00:09:46.670
This pulse works directly on the robot's AI and makes it invisible.

00:09:47.410 --> 00:09:50.590
No matter how new the robot is, if you take a step into the effective field,

00:09:51.950 --> 00:09:55.910
even if it is an atom, it is powerless here.

00:09:56.170 --> 00:09:57.680
You don't need to worry.

00:10:00.120 --> 00:10:04.860
The thing is, when you get a new toy, you forget about the old ones.

00:10:05.100 --> 00:10:08.600
In that respect, this Skunk-sama will treasure the old ones.

00:10:15.060 --> 00:10:17.500
Due to the high temperature, it's too late for dinner today.

00:10:17.930 --> 00:10:26.860
What is it?

00:10:50.410 --> 00:10:54.200
Miss, you've seen something you can't do.

00:11:10.750 --> 00:11:11.590
What? What's wrong?

00:11:40.580 --> 00:11:41.860
Jumbo is in Kuroideru Prison?

00:11:42.730 --> 00:11:43.850
Switch to the video from the scene.

00:11:45.060 --> 00:11:45.280
Bye!

00:11:49.740 --> 00:11:50.780
What do you mean?

00:12:01.020 --> 00:12:02.620
Is an old robot like this okay?

00:12:03.520 --> 00:12:18.080
I've strengthened it with a detector.

00:12:18.480 --> 00:12:20.330
Please wait, boss.

00:12:20.550 --> 00:12:22.050
I'm going to pick you up now.

00:12:28.250 --> 00:12:28.550
Jump!

00:12:35.210 --> 00:12:36.850
Is that pulse also effective in the air car?

00:12:37.910 --> 00:12:46.500
The Asian Pulse is operating normally.

00:12:47.080 --> 00:12:51.920
Why? Why can that robot move?

00:12:52.500 --> 00:12:59.900
The new and simple structure of Jumbo is the latest...

00:13:00.000 --> 00:13:01.400
My Guardian Pulse won't work!

00:13:01.900 --> 00:13:04.910
Doctor, is there something wrong?

00:13:05.670 --> 00:13:10.150
Atom, in order to get rid of Skanko, his men brought back Jumbo!

00:13:11.530 --> 00:13:12.920
Huh? Jumbo?

00:13:13.280 --> 00:13:25.620
D-D-Delete the Guardian Pulse!

00:13:30.000 --> 00:13:30.580
What are you going to do, director?

00:13:31.500 --> 00:13:33.520
I don't know.

00:13:33.940 --> 00:13:35.640
Disable the Guardian Pulse.

00:13:36.700 --> 00:13:37.740
Yes, sir.

00:13:38.320 --> 00:13:49.160
I'm a little embarrassed.

00:13:49.460 --> 00:13:52.360
If you stop the pulse, you'll be in a bad mood.

00:14:03.130 --> 00:14:03.410
Welcome.

00:14:18.070 --> 00:14:19.050
What's going on?

00:14:20.150 --> 00:14:21.870
This prison with the latest equipment...

00:14:24.150 --> 00:14:27.570
I can't believe that a big robot like you can easily break the thread.

00:14:29.690 --> 00:14:29.950
and

00:14:30.000 --> 00:14:32.600
It means that the Jamboro robot also has its own way of using it.

00:14:34.020 --> 00:14:37.120
Oh, the latest robot has also come.

00:14:37.740 --> 00:14:39.610
Atom!

00:14:39.730 --> 00:14:41.100
You guys!

00:14:41.300 --> 00:14:42.680
Be quiet.

00:14:43.300 --> 00:14:44.190
It's okay.

00:14:44.810 --> 00:14:48.090
I won't forgive you for using Jumbo for bad things!

00:14:49.410 --> 00:14:57.680
The latest robot is very effective.

00:15:08.030 --> 00:15:09.450
That Atom won't be able to move.

00:15:10.030 --> 00:15:11.800
It's a big device.

00:15:13.240 --> 00:15:15.330
We have to do something about it.

00:15:23.560 --> 00:15:23.800
Take this!

00:15:24.300 --> 00:15:26.620
Jiro!

00:15:27.090 --> 00:15:28.220
Let's go!

00:15:44.720 --> 00:15:45.660
Hold on tight!

00:16:00.190 --> 00:16:13.680
I won't stop until I destroy the whole city!

00:16:15.660 --> 00:16:17.780
All units, follow Skunk!

00:16:18.280 --> 00:16:21.710
I, Jumbo, will head to the defense line of Wanan!

00:16:38.120 --> 00:16:38.840
I'll finish off Jumbo here!

00:16:48.010 --> 00:16:48.550
Get out of my way!

00:16:49.380 --> 00:16:50.240
Look at that figure!

00:16:51.410 --> 00:16:52.770
He's not a Jumbo anymore!

00:16:57.420 --> 00:16:57.880
Commencing attack!

00:17:32.640 --> 00:17:32.740
Thank you for watching!

00:18:02.490 --> 00:18:03.960
Atom, get out of the way!

00:18:05.350 --> 00:18:06.610
I want to lose!

00:18:07.090 --> 00:18:18.480
Zensokoton!

00:18:19.000 --> 00:18:25.210
Sensei is trying to bring Jumbo back to his true self.

00:18:26.810 --> 00:18:27.930
Prepare to attack!

00:18:28.230 --> 00:18:29.220
Aim for Jumbo's head!

00:18:30.700 --> 00:18:31.100
Thank you for watching!

00:18:41.930 --> 00:18:42.230
Thank you for watching.

00:18:43.240 --> 00:18:43.640
To Jumbo!

00:18:44.100 --> 00:18:45.740
The first time I met Midori-sensei!

00:18:47.080 --> 00:18:47.980
I'll make you remember!

00:18:49.220 --> 00:18:49.680
I can't do it!

00:18:50.280 --> 00:18:51.460
Get ready for fireworks!

00:18:52.840 --> 00:18:53.040
Keep!

00:18:54.500 --> 00:18:55.540
I have an idea!

00:18:57.160 --> 00:18:57.580
Listen to the jump!

00:19:04.670 --> 00:19:04.930
Yeah!

00:19:35.500 --> 00:19:43.270
A big, a big robot Jumbo

00:19:44.350 --> 00:19:51.010
We were waiting for you

00:19:51.380 --> 00:19:57.280
A strong and kind human

00:20:00.250 --> 00:20:05.450
Let's make a wonderful future together.

00:20:06.830 --> 00:20:25.510
How do you make fireworks?

00:20:25.890 --> 00:20:27.540
It would be nice if this worked out.

00:20:47.110 --> 00:20:48.510
Jumbo's electric circuit is...

00:20:48.840 --> 00:20:50.920
It reacts to the brightness of the light and acts.

00:20:52.190 --> 00:20:52.710
I had it programmed.

00:20:53.580 --> 00:20:53.980
That's how it is.

00:20:54.900 --> 00:20:57.020
It seems that he succeeded in evoking the old memories.

00:21:03.000 --> 00:21:06.170
It's a cute song

00:21:30.480 --> 00:21:31.460
It's all thanks to Dr. Ochanomizu.

00:21:32.100 --> 00:21:38.600
The Faculty of Science took Jumbo and made him able to play with the children here again.

00:21:39.260 --> 00:21:43.820
Jumbo, I'm so happy to be able to be friends with a lot of children.

00:21:47.020 --> 00:21:49.700
I don't think Jumbo was lonely.

00:21:52.160 --> 00:21:54.600
Because Nidori-sensei was here.

00:22:12.600 --> 00:22:22.480
Why, why does my heart hurt and turn into tears?

00:22:23.070 --> 00:22:28.560
Why, why are my tears...

00:22:30.000 --> 00:22:37.600
I'll become a bird and hold your little knee

00:22:39.240 --> 00:22:53.840
And look up at the sky again

00:23:00.000 --> 00:23:02.740
It's high, it's high

00:23:03.160 --> 00:23:04.630
It's supposed to be higher than that cloud

00:23:10.340 --> 00:23:29.390
It's good, watch it!

00:23:30.060 --> 00:23:31.940
Next time, Uran is born!

00:23:32.320 --> 00:23:33.330
The future with the heart!
